  "description": "A lord with a touch of reverse since childhood.\n\nThe moment you end up causing harm to even your beloved pet and vow never to raise anything again, receives Calculus as a gift from a mysterious man.\n\nCalculus, who becomes a presence that will always be by your side without even hurting your own hands.\n\nThe lord believes his words and gives Calculus the name 'Oki'.\n\nBefore long, 'Oki' grew up healthy just as the man had said and established himself as Young-ju's most precious friend....\n\nYeongju's first night living on his own after entering university.\n\nAs he opened his eyes to a strange sensation, a handsome man appeared before him!\n\n\"I’ve wanted to touch the Lord all this time. You have no idea how long I’ve waited for this moment.\"\n\nThis beautiful man groping the Lord's body is Oki?!\n\n\"I like you, Young-ju. Will you have my child?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4895001450), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12119803), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/mycalculus), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/my_calculus), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000067349), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250121)",
